# Messaging

Full write-up: `docs/MESSAGING.md`.

## Piece context in the thread

When a visitor inquires about a piece, prepend `@Piece Title` into the **message body**
via `withPieceTag` so history stays clear for visitor and Mark. Render with
`ChatBubbleBody`. Do not hide the piece name only on the thread row.

## Payment pills

Mark taps PayPal / Zelle → **Finalize info** (edit name/price) → Done → draft pill → Send.
Token: `[[payment:paypal|t=…|a=235|n=…]]`. Handles live in `site_settings`; edit via admin
gear → **Payment options**.

## Email

Requires `RESEND_API_KEY` + `MARK_NOTIFY_EMAIL`. Unread live messages wait ~2 minutes
before email (cancelled if Mark opens the thread). Cron: `/api/cron/chat-reminders`.

## Auth boundary

Visitor chat uses **email + cookies**, not Supabase Auth and not a password. Never put
visitors into `auth.users` for chat — that would risk `/admin` access.

Contact UI: **New chat** · **Continue chat** · **Email Mark**. Same `visitor_email`
always resumes the thread in `chat_threads` (passcode column is unused for verification).
